@startuml
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #3333C4
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #FFFFFF
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
title Successful partial lesson edit (original lesson excluded from clashes)
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic #3333C4
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser #3333C4
participant "edit:LessonEditCommand" as Edit #3333C4
participant "descriptor:EditLessonDescriptor" as Descriptor #3333C4
participant "<u>LessonSchedule</u>" as Schedule #9D0012
participant "m:ModelManager" as Model #9D0012
participant ":StorageManager" as Storage #A38300

[-> Logic : execute("lesson edit 1 st/17:00")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(...)
activate Parser
note over Parser, Descriptor : LessonCommandParser delegates to LessonEditCommandParser.\nThe parser creates the partial descriptor and edit command.
Parser --> Logic : edit
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : current data
note over Logic : Copy data into a snapshot.
Logic -> Edit : execute(m)
activate Edit
Edit -> Model : getAddressBook().getStudentList()
Model --> Edit : full roster
Edit -> Schedule : from(students)
activate Schedule
Schedule --> Edit : weekly schedule
deactivate Schedule
note over Edit : Resolve original entry by lesson index.\nIts owner may be hidden in the student view.
Edit -> Descriptor : applyTo(original.lesson())
activate Descriptor
Descriptor --> Edit : replacement
deactivate Descriptor
note over Edit : Validate subject, changed values and duplicates.
Edit -> Schedule : findClashes(students, replacement, original)
activate Schedule
note right of Schedule : Exclude the original owner/lesson pair.\nCheck all other lessons in weekly order.
Schedule --> Edit : empty clash list
deactivate Schedule
note over Edit : Replace original at the same insertion position\nin a copy of its owner's lessons.
Edit -> Model : setStudent(owner, owner.withLessons(updated))
activate Model
Model --> Edit
deactivate Model
Edit --> Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Edit
note over Logic : Data differs from the snapshot.
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(m.getAddressBook())
activate Storage
Storage --> Logic
deactivate Storage
[<-- Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Logic
note over Logic, Storage : Validation failures do not change data. If saving throws IOException,\nLogicManager restores the snapshot and reports the edit-specific failure message.\nThese failure paths are omitted from this successful scenario.
@enduml
